  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>New technology and creative tactical thinking have long featured in FWLM infantry deployment, with varied unit types and specialized formations treated as the norm rather than the exception. Motorized platoons provide the speed the FWLM needs to cover the vast distances between garrison posts on provincial worlds, mounting troops on light vehicles that can respond to threats faster than foot infantry but without the expense of full mechanization. Trained as combat engineers, these troops carry specialized equipment for rapid construction of field fortifications, obstacle emplacement, and demolition operations, providing commanders with the ability to reshape terrain to tactical advantage.</p>"
